Subject: CPMS I03D Independent Schema and Typed Reader Observation Semantic Refinement

@ [refinement_uuid] 2d39794e-106e-4331-8e11-5d6b83dd9928

& [ReaderBinding] is the exact relation among root direction document identity Rust type intended use operation and activated dependency profile
& [ObservationSubject] is exact input bytes for an input root or one immutable typed fixture for an output root
& [SourceIdentity] is the original I03B byte digest for inputs and the admitted fixture digest plus serialized byte digest for outputs

& [SchemaReader] is the selected validator operating on one bounded Value projection under explicit Draft format and no-resolution policy
  + it is an independent observation mechanism
  + it is not a universal JSON Schema oracle

& [TypedReader] is serde deserialization into the exact input Rust type or serialization from the exact response Rust type
  + it observes representability and structural binding
  + it does not execute business semantic or authority rules

& [ValueProjection] is the schema reader's serde_json Value plus canonical projection digest
  + exact source spelling ordering escapes and numeric token evidence remain separate
& [TypedProjection] is deterministic serialization of a successfully bound typed value
  + it is normalized evidence rather than a byte round trip claim

& [ReaderDisposition] is accepted rejected exhausted internal_fault not_applicable or skipped_dependency
& [ObservationStage] is binding representation validation deserialization serialization completion or normalization
  + disposition states outcome
  + stage states where it arose

& [SchemaRejection] requires at least one stable normalized rule finding from a completed applicable validator
& [TypedRejection] requires a serde data-category error during actual type binding
& [RepresentationExhaustion] means the selected reader representation could not faithfully carry the subject to its declared operation

& [ReaderPair] is co-present independent observations under one binding and subject identity
  + it has no agreement compatibility pass or authority field
  + disagreement becomes meaningful only when I03E applies an explicit CommonSyntaxClaim and expectation

& [DenyRetriever] is a zero-capability sentinel required by construction
  + every call deterministically refuses
  + a call is an invariant failure because reference preflight should have closed the graph

& [ResidualCarry] is a set of I03C identifiers applicable to the bound root and subject
  + carry is referential
  + neither reader changes registry disposition

& [RefinedDisposition] is two_independent_bounded_observations_without_reconciliation
